    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We ask the committee to approve a first-loss tranche of 10 per cent of the facility, which is USD 25m on the current size."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Why 10 per cent"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "It is the smallest tranche that keeps senior lenders at their required coverage ratio.",
        "Development partners have indicated appetite up to USD 30m.",
        "A larger tranche would reduce the leverage the facility achieves."
      ]
    },
